{"ts":"2026-07-06T22:10:15.407Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"Found in audit #15 follow-up: pm update --body-file - fails with ENOENT (tries to open a file literally named '-'), while pm notes --add - reads stdin. Agents composing bodies from heredocs/pipes (the grep/jq/heredoc composability principle) hit this asymmetry and fall back to temp files. Inventory every --*-file flag via pm contracts, route them through a shared read-file-or-stdin helper, and record the convention in the scripting contract. Related-not-duplicate: pm-kipd (GH-438 full-item JSON on stdin), pm-a2h3 (notes/learnings --stdin parity)."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-iktj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Uniform stdin convention: every --*-file flag (body-file, close --reason-file, etc.) accepts '-' for stdin, matching the annotation --add - convention"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","composability"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T22:10:15.407Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T22:10:15.407Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"All file-reading flags across commands accept '-' to read stdin (inventory taken from contracts); behavior documented in the scripting contract (pm-psy1); error message for unreadable paths mentions the '-' option; tests cover piped heredoc usage; no behavior change for real paths"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"c3a2cca5910385fe1be123c509869cf786889a36170ca76ecace9776e9e422ee","message":""}
